   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 225,
   "text": "Employers are usually happy to help, but in some instances, they may refuse to verify your employment. This is typically due to privacy or regulatory concerns, but there are steps borrowers can take if these challenges arise.",
