   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 220,
   "text": "Mortgage lenders use this information to calculate several metrics to determine the likelihood that a borrower will repay a loan. A change in employment status can have a significant impact on the borrower’s application.",
