   "textLength": 407,
   "text": "There can also be state laws or company rules against sharing particular employment-related information. Talk to your employer to determine if some general rule prevents them from sharing. If so, ask them to explain that to your prospective mortgage lender. Some lenders might be willing to process an application if they understand that another state’s laws prevent them from verifying certain infor",
