   "textLength": 393,
   "text": "Finally, there are some cases where an employer will not verify employment for other reasons. At this point, it might be time to consider getting a new job. Why won’t the employer verify your employment? Could they be doing something illegal? Does your employer have something against you? In the long run, you will likely be better off getting out of such a bad situation as soon as possible.",
