   "text": "At What Point in the Mortgage Process Does a Lender Ask for Employment Verification?\nWhen you apply for a mortgage, you’ll typically give the lender some financial information, including your employer and income. The lender will verify this information during the underwriting process in order to approve you for a mortgage. That process happens days to weeks before closing. However, since mortgages",
