   "text": "What Happens if a Lender Cannot Verify Your Employment?\nIt is possible for a loan to be denied during the underwriting process, so you’ll want to do everything you can to make sure that doesn’t happen. If the lender can’t verify your employment through the human resources department, be sure to call the department and explain your situation. You can also ask the lender whether supporting documenta",
